Could be better. The game wants to emulate a Linux-like shell , but fails at some basic tasks.
A few Examples: 
[list]
[*]Files inside a Folder aren't recognised.[spoiler]For example scp bin/SSHcrack.exe[/spoiler]
[*]Using / to access the Top-Level-Directory doesn't exist.[spoiler]cd / works. But not rm /logs/*[/spoiler]
[*]There is no copy feature , just moving/renaming.[spoiler]If I want to copy something I have to use scp and upload[/spoiler]
[*]Repetition. Just Type the same sequence of commands 100 times. (See Spoiler below.)
[/list]

I will update this , when I notice changes. 

[spoiler]
The Game loop in the style of Java code:
probe();
if(firewall){overloadProxy();}
openPorts();
backdoor();
downloading();
scan();
deleteLogs();
exit();
[/spoiler]
